- README.ja.md added (a Japanese translation of README.md).
- scripts/skim.py: the scanner's view cuts text written without spaces (Japanese, Chinese) by characters, and a
  sentence also ends at an ideographic full stop (tests/first-reader/test_cjk.py).
- references/lookup.md added: the procedure for a page that is looked things up in (a manual, a cheat sheet);
